node_modules/
*.tmp
**/state.json
**/state.json.*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*

# Chat history never belongs in this repository. The viewer indexes transcripts from
# ~/.pi/agent/sessions at run time and every test writes its own room into a t.TempDir, so a
# .jsonl under version control can only ever be someone's real conversation. **/state.json
# above already covers a copy of the room state.
*.jsonl

# Output generated *from* the viewer, as opposed to the UI itself: a curl of the running
# server, a saved DOM dump, a screenshot, a one-page export. The interface is the hand-written
# template at viewer/ui/index.html, which go:embed compiles into the binary and which is
# tracked. These rules deliberately do not reach into viewer/ui/.
viewer/*.html
viewer/*.dom.html
viewer/*.render.html
viewer/*.png
viewer/*.jpg
viewer/tmp/

# Build and test artefacts. CI builds to /tmp for the same reason.
/viewer/viewer
/viewer/pi-team-viewer
*.test
coverage.*
